<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" agent="Branch connected diagrams" version="24.7.17" type="device"><diagram id="ui" name="User journey"><mxGraphModel grid="1" gridSize="10" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2520" pageHeight="2800" background="#FFFFFF"><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="title" value="BRANCH / User journey" style="text;html=0;align=left;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=36;fontColor=#243A2F;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="100" y="30" width="2200" height="60" as="geometry" /></mxCell><object id="U08" label="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#69766E&quot;&gt;START&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Recorder&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Default app entry. Ready state puts a large Record control above the fold; a deliberate tap starts recording. The platform microphone prompt appears only when permission is needed. Ready and active are states of this same screen, not two routes. Active state shows elapsed time and Pause/Resume/Stop. Stop finalizes and saves before U04. Library and Import are secondary ready-state actions. Do not require scrolling, menus, a title, project filing, AI setup, login or an onboarding tour before first recording. Resume an active/interrupted capture safely on return; never start a second recording automatically."><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#426E57;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243A2F;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=27;spacing=19;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="200" y="220" width="260" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell></object><object id="U01" label="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#69766E&quot;&gt;U01&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Library&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Secondary destination opened from the recorder or global navigation. Browse sources and projects, search or import material. Opening the app normally starts at U08, not here."><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#426E57;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243A2F;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=27;spacing=19;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="200" y="700" width="260" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell></object><object id="U02" label="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#69766E&quot;&gt;U02&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Add material&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="A compact entry sheet. Import, paste and quick note open the same input dialog. Record opens the phone recorder. Cancel returns to Library."><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BCCBC1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243A2F;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=27;spacing=19;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="220" width="260" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell></object><object id="U03" label="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#69766E&quot;&gt;U03&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Import / write&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Text and transcripts are parsed; images and other media can remain attachments. Do not promise automatic interpretation of every format. Unsupported input offers a paste or attachment fallback."><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BCCBC1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243A2F;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=27;spacing=19;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1180" y="220" width="260" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell></object><object id="U04" label="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#69766E&quot;&gt;U04&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Source saved&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="After Stop, finalize and persist the recording before showing saved success. Use a default session title; renaming and project filing are optional. No second Save tap is required for recording. Build idea map uses an existing allowed AI preference or opens U07 for first-use consent. Keep audio only goes to the saved source without AI. Imports reach this screen after successful validation/save. Failed persistence uses U09 and retains recoverable capture data."><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BCCBC1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243A2F;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=27;spacing=19;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1660" y="360" width="260" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell></object><object id="U05" label="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#69766E&quot;&gt;U05&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Source detail&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="The original source remains accessible while optional processing runs. With permitted AI, show progress and a direct Review ideas action to U11 when ready; Updates is an alternative for returning later, not a mandatory detour. With AI off, play/read the source or open U10 to create an idea manually. Leaving does not dismiss a draft or delete the source."><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BCCBC1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243A2F;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=27;spacing=19;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1660" y="700" width="260" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell></object><object id="U06" label="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#69766E&quot;&gt;U06&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Updates&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Persistent primary navigation destination. Proposals are visible separately from accepted graph records. A ready badge leads here; users are not forced to review every suggestion before reading a source."><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BCCBC1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243A2F;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=27;spacing=19;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1660" y="1020" width="260" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell></object><object id="U07" label="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#69766E&quot;&gt;U07&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;AI settings&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Open from ordinary settings or after U04 Build idea map when no AI processing permission exists. Choose allowed processing for the saved material before any cloud/model step. Continue to U05; cancel returns to the invoking screen. Recording itself does not require AI consent."><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BCCBC1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243A2F;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=27;spacing=19;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2100" y="200" width="260" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell></object><object id="U09" label="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#69766E&quot;&gt;U09&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Retry / recover&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="An error state, not a new top-level destination. Keep successfully saved material and show the failed step. Do not report an empty map as successful processing. Cancel or navigate back without losing a saved source."><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BCCBC1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243A2F;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=27;spacing=19;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2100" y="700" width="260" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell></object><object id="U10" label="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#69766E&quot;&gt;U10&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Node editor&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Full-screen mobile editor for manual nodes, existing ideas or a proposed draft. Types: Idea, Question, Constraint, Finding and Decision. Saving a manual/accepted idea writes a revision and opens the map. Saving a draft returns to U11 for explicit acceptance without writing accepted graph content. Cancel returns to the invoking context. Original sources remain unchanged."><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BCCBC1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243A2F;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=27;spacing=19;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="1240" width="260" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell></object><object id="U11" label="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#69766E&quot;&gt;U11&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Draft review&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Open directly from U05 when ideas are ready, or from Updates later. Inspect the source before accepting selected ideas/relationships; acceptance opens U14. Draft edits in U10 return to review without publishing. Dismissal keeps the original source."><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BCCBC1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243A2F;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=27;spacing=19;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1200" y="1020" width="260" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell></object><object id="U12" label="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#69766E&quot;&gt;U12&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Search results&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Text search is available without AI. Results may include sources and ideas. Idea results open Node detail; source results open Source detail U05. Results and snippets respect the current access scope."><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BCCBC1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243A2F;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=27;spacing=19;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="200" y="1790" width="260" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell></object><object id="U13" label="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#69766E&quot;&gt;U13&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Related ideas&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="A focused suggestion drawer rather than an endless feed. Search remains available when AI is off. A suggested match never silently creates an accepted relationship."><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BCCBC1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243A2F;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=27;spacing=19;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1660" y="1910" width="260" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell></object><object id="U14" label="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#69766E&quot;&gt;U14&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Project map&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Focused accepted ideas for a session or project. A first session opens here without forcing a project name or filing decision. Explore an idea, read evidence, edit, reuse or export. Library remains secondary; Record is available for the next capture. Accepted records remain separate from proposals."><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#426E57;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243A2F;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=27;spacing=19;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1200" y="1540" width="260" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell></object><object id="U15" label="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#69766E&quot;&gt;U15&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Idea details&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Shows one node or relationship with its original evidence, state and version. Follow a connection updates the selected item in this drawer. The map remains visible behind it."><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BCCBC1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243A2F;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=27;spacing=19;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1200" y="1930" width="260" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell></object><object id="U16" label="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#69766E&quot;&gt;U16&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Source viewer&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Only offer audio seeking when a recording and real timestamp exist. Imported text without audio opens its original text range. Missing or deleted evidence is labeled, not replaced with invented support."><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BCCBC1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243A2F;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=27;spacing=19;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="2220" width="260" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell></object><object id="U17" label="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#69766E&quot;&gt;U17&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Filters&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Filtering changes the view, not the stored graph. Draft, disputed, current and superseded records must remain distinguishable."><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BCCBC1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243A2F;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=27;spacing=19;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="1540" width="260" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell></object><object id="U18" label="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#69766E&quot;&gt;U18&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Reuse idea&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Linking adds a project association to the same idea. Branching creates a derivative with a relationship to its source idea. Neither overwrites the original project context."><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BCCBC1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243A2F;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=27;spacing=19;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1660" y="1420" width="260" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell></object><object id="U19" label="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#69766E&quot;&gt;U19&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;History&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Restoring creates a new revision through the editor; it does not erase the audit trail. Shared restoration follows project review policy. Show who changed what and which source supported it."><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BCCBC1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243A2F;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=27;spacing=19;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1200" y="2460" width="260" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell></object><object id="U20" label="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#69766E&quot;&gt;U20&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Delete source?&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Delete the selected source only after a clear confirmation. Remove source content and derived retrieval entries as specified by retention rules. Graph nodes are not automatically reclassified as false; unavailable evidence is marked and stale suggestions are invalidated."><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BCCBC1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243A2F;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=27;spacing=19;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="2520" width="260" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell></object><object id="U21" label="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#69766E&quot;&gt;U21&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Share preview&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Later expansion. Preview nodes, edges, excerpts and files. Mixed private/shared material needs exclusion or deliberate redaction. Sharing an entire personal library is never the default."><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BCCBC1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243A2F;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=27;spacing=19;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2100" y="1540" width="260" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell></object><object id="U22" label="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#69766E&quot;&gt;U22&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Invite / access&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Later expansion. Roles and source access must be compatible. Confirming the invitation makes only the previewed project material available. Do not imply that downloaded or exported copies can be recalled."><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BCCBC1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243A2F;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=27;spacing=19;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2100" y="1860" width="260" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell></object><object id="U23" label="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#69766E&quot;&gt;U23&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Shared map&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Later expansion of the same screen model. Incoming sources and edits propose changes to a persistent project record rather than creating a new disconnected meeting artifact."><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BCCBC1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243A2F;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=27;spacing=19;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2100" y="2180" width="260" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell></object><object id="U24" label="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#69766E&quot;&gt;U24&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Comments&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Later expansion. Project participants can discuss ideas and propose edits. Review uses Draft review U11 with the appropriate project roles; disagreement does not automatically become consensus."><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BCCBC1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243A2F;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=27;spacing=19;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;dashed=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2100" y="2500" width="260" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell></object><object id="U25" label="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:15px;color:#69766E&quot;&gt;U25&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Export preview&lt;/b&gt;" tooltip="Mobile export screen opened from the project menu. Preview selected nodes, relationships, sources and uncertainty before exporting. Recheck permitted scope. The operating-system share sheet is not a separate Branch screen. Export is available without AI; this fills the UI gap for the existing portability requirement."><mxCell style="rounded=1;arcSize=15;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BCCBC1;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#243A2F;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=27;spacing=19;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;dashed=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2100" y="1150" width="260" height="100" as="geometry" /></mxCell></object><object id="edge0" label="Add" tooltip="Add material"><mxCell style="edgeStyle=segmentEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=12;html=1;endArrow=open;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#426E57;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=24;fontColor=#426E57;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=0.6538461538461539;exitY=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;dashed=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="U01" target="U02"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="370" y="660" /><mxPoint x="830" y="660" /></Array><mxPoint x="-150.0" y="29.0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell></object><object id="edge1" label="Import / write" tooltip="Import / write"><mxCell style="edgeStyle=segmentEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=12;html=1;endArrow=open;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#426E57;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=24;fontColor=#426E57;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;dashed=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="U02" target="U03"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points" /><mxPoint x="0.0" y="29.0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell></object><object id="edge2" label="" tooltip="Continue"><mxCell style="edgeStyle=segmentEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jumpStyle=arc;jumpSize=12;html=1;endArrow=open;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#426E57;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=24;fontColor=#426E57;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;dashed=0;" edge="1" parent="1" 